Annual Capital Recovery[electricity source]=
	(Weighted Average Cost of Capital*(1 + Weighted Average Cost of Capital)^20) / ((1 +\
		 Weighted Average Cost of Capital)^20 - 1)
	*(This Year CAPEX[electricity source]-Subsidy per Unit New Capacity[electricity source\
		])
	~	$/MW
	~		|

